Subject: [PATCH] ECM drones jam; TargetManager learns jamming

- TargetManager::Jam(durationMS) clears the entity's locks and blocks StartTargeting (both the player
  and the NPC overloads) until the jam ends; IsJammed().
- DroneAIMgr::TryJam(): each cycle, chance = drone's scan<Type>StrengthBonus for the target's strongest
  sensor type / target's scan<Type>Strength; on success the target is jammed for the drone's cycle time
  and the controlling pilot (and a jammed pilot) get a notify message.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GZgkReFMTa8JWavQEivVUA
